ManaBrew Protocol Specification
https://docs.manabrew.app/protocol/ and its linked protocol pages

The JSON examples in this directory are reconstructed from the ManaBrew
protocol specification, which is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

They were rewritten as compact single-line fixtures for round-trip tests, so
they are adapted from, not byte-identical to, the published examples.

No source code from the ManaBrew reference implementation is included.
